```

## Charts (recharts)
```javascript
import { BarChart, Bar, XAxis, YAxis, Tooltip, ResponsiveContainer, PieChart, Pie, Cell } from 'recharts';
// Always wrap in <ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height={N}>
// Dark theme tooltip: contentStyle={{ background: T.card, border: `1px solid ${T.border}` }}
```

## DO NOT
- Use `window.location.href` for navigation → use `useNavigate()`
- Use `document.getElementById()` → use React refs
- Hardcode farm_id → always from `useAuth().farmId`
- Add global CSS → inline styles with T.* tokens
- Use class components → always functional with hooks
